<title>UK: ING unit sets 1.0 bln Czech crown three-year bond. [Corrected 11:48 gmt]</title>
<headline>ING unit sets 1.0 bln Czech crown three-year bond. [Corrected 11:48 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING VERZEKERINGEN</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.625    MATURITY    20.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.075   PAY DATE    20.JAN.97</p>
<p>(Corrects issue price from &quot;101.75&quot;)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100	 SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA-	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 25-50-100 SALE LIMS US/UK/NL/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.00</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN ENTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
